                            <comment id="497446" author="gerrit" created="Wed, 8 Jul 2026 04:28:07 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&quot;Timothy Day &amp;lt;timday@thelustrecollective.com&amp;gt;&quot; uploaded a new patch: &lt;a href=&quot;https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/67113&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/67113&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Subject: &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20455&quot; title=&quot;Split test suites into individual files by test case&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-20455&quot;&gt;LU-20455&lt;/a&gt; tests: split sanity-lsnapshot by subtest&lt;br/&gt;
